{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Echo 是一款極簡風格的日子記錄工具，把倒數、累計日數、紀念日與私人日記整合在同一個應用之內，適合重視私隱、不願內容上傳雲端的用戶。程式沒有廣告、沒有內購、不需註冊帳號，所有資料只留存在你的裝置之中。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-202.webp\">\n<h2>四頁整理紀念日與日記</h2>\n<p>開啟後分為紀念日、日記、洞察與設定四個分頁。你可建立倒數、累計日數及各類紀念日，並設定本機提醒；日記支援心情標籤、事件連結、搜尋與篩選，亦可把目前檢視匯出成 PDF 手帳。洞察頁整理事件分佈、書寫活躍度與心情趨勢，On This Day 帶你回看往年今日。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-347-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-348-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-349-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-350-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-351-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Echo: Anniversary</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T03:38:52.683935+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:24:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:18:11.267601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:34.658408+00:00","content_hash":"34004f0f936ce7a4dfcd783637e08ba4f21bbbfaa07196c5bcec8aeb81792896","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}